  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Global Gateway Investment Preparation Facility for Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Facility will help create a favorable investment environment for Global Gateway investments in Sri Lanka, with the overall objective of increasing the country&#xbf;s attractiveness for such investments, including potential flagship projects. The intervention aims to enhance the pipeline of Global Gateway investments through the development of transformative, scalable, and replicable bankable project proposals, supported by collaboration between government, the EU private sector, and financial institutions, including pilot implementations. It also focuses on institutional strengthening and capacity building of public and private stakeholders to better identify, structure, and manage bankable projects and innovative financial instruments. In parallel, the action will establish and strengthen investment partnerships, stakeholder networks, and policy dialogues to address regulatory barriers, promote knowledge sharing and co-investment, and support evidence-based decision-making for Global Gateway priorities in Sri Lanka.</narrative>
  </description>
